        <item>
            <title>Version 1.1.3</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: Another pass at the trash drop dead zone — drops released at the very bottom of the trash icon are now recovered when the drag session ends, which fires reliably even where macOS blocks the drop itself.

Bug fixes: Trash drop recovery moved to a hook that always fires; works regardless of where your macOS Dock is positioned.
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 20:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
