        <item>
            <title>Version 1.1.2</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: The taskbar now auto-hides in fullscreen and slides up when you move the mouse to the bottom edge, instead of staying visible.

New features: Fullscreen detection now works even without Accessibility permission (falls back to a window-size check).

Bug fixes: Fixed the Enable Taskbar toggle showing OFF after an update while the taskbar was running. Settings window opens more reliably. Launch at login defaults on for new installs.
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 19:30:00 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1043</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
