        </item>

        <item>
            <title>Version 1.1.1</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: The trash bin now accepts files dropped on its bottom edge too. macOS won't deliver drops to the very bottom of the screen, so MacWin now detects the release itself and trashes the file. The trash icon stays exactly where it is.

Bug fixes: Fixed the trash drop dead zone at the bottom of the screen, without moving the taskbar.
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 18:45:00 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1042</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
