        </item>

        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.9</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: The trash bin now accepts dropped files across its whole area, not just the top edge. You can even drop a file anywhere on the taskbar to send it to the Trash.

Bug fixes: Fixed the long-standing trash drop bug — drags were accepted on hover but the drop silently never completed (a missing prepareForDragOperation on the taskbar view).
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 17:15:00 -0400</pubDate>
