        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.8</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: Restores reliable auto-updates. The custom update window introduced earlier wasn't appearing, so MacWin now uses the standard, battle-tested update dialog. This is the build that fixes updates.

Bug fixes: Update prompts reliably appear again.
            ]]></description>
