        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.6</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: Fixes drag-and-drop dead zones on the taskbar. App icons were silently rejecting file drags over their entire area instead of letting the taskbar's trash handling take over.

Bug fixes: Only the trash button claims drags now; everywhere else on the bar routes files to the trash correctly. Also adds drop diagnostics so any remaining drop issue can be pinpointed exactly.
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 15:50:00 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1037</sparkle:version>
