        </item>

        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.5</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: Attempts to fix the trash icon only accepting files dropped on its top edge. The taskbar now sits above the macOS Dock in window order so the Dock can't steal drops on the lower part of the trash icon. If it still misbehaves, moving the macOS Dock to the left or right side (Settings, Behavior, macOS Dock) is the guaranteed fix.

Bug fixes: Taskbar window level raised above the macOS Dock.
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 15:20:00 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1036</sparkle:version>
