        </item>

        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.4</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
Important: Brand-new MacWin-styled update window — the one you're looking at right now. Replaces the plain Sparkle dialog.

New features: The update prompt now shows the version you're moving to, collapsible release-note sections, and a live download progress bar.

Bug fixes: Update prompts now reliably come to the front instead of hiding behind other windows.
            ]]></description>
